        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1e293b&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;How does one agent call become a trace and token counts per project, and what keeps prompts out of the storage?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: OpenTelemetry GenAI and MCP conventions (status Development) through the existing Alloy, to Tempo and VictoriaMetrics, read in Grafana, proposal of 2026-10-23 · drawn in full: what the proposal adds (IA-1) · faded: what already runs&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: Langfuse (about 21.5 GB of memory minimum, not for this cluster) · OpenCost for cluster cost · the GPU server&amp;#39;s own metrics&lt;br&gt;Assumed: VictoriaMetrics already runs and takes Alloy&amp;#39;s remote write; Tempo in monolithic mode&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp · OpenTelemetry GenAI semantic conventions, Grafana Alloy components&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
